---------------
Added my name to it.

* ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
File: bai.out.R
---------------
Similar optimizations as to bai.in.R. One particular optimization was
to replace max(cumsum(dat2)) with sum(dat2), which gives the same
result (but faster) when there are no negative values, as in ring
width series.

